  <item>
    <title>#005 上海天文馆里的星空漫想</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6744442811045e78e5c2fdc4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6744442811045e78e5c2fdc4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 09:42:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>灵感买家俱乐部：</span><a href="https://ling.school/play/" data-url="https://ling.school/play/"><span>ling.school</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.icloud.com/freeform/0d8_QauDy-cLZh1ZiJ7-xcQAA" data-url="https://www.icloud.com/freeform/0d8_QauDy-cLZh1ZiJ7-xcQAA"><span>点击这里</span></a><span>可以查看本期有关补充笔记（由于使用工具为无边记，因此仅支持Apple设备）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 关于Alan Lightman</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 参观建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 关于上海天文馆的建筑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 《偶然的宇宙》中关于傅科摆的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 「家园」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 《浩瀚的宇宙》片段摘选</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 「宇宙」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 《知晓无限的男人》片段摘选</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 从有序到无序、《信条》以及大爆炸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 《大爆炸之前是什么？》片段摘选</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 「假如剧场」展教活动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a> 暗能量——「科学房间中隐形的大象」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 「征程」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a>《可能的不可能》片段摘选&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>BGM:</span></p><ul><li><p><span>No Roadmap To Adulthood | Prelude In C Sharp Major - Alice Sara Ott</span></p></li><li><p><span>Where We're Going - Hans Zimmer</span></p></li><li><p><span>Timer - Francesco De Luca &amp; Alessandro Forti</span></p></li><li><p><span>Illumination - Kai Engel</span></p></li><li><p><span>Endurance - Aerian</span></p></li></ul><p><span>封面：Midjourney</span></p><p><em><span>prompt：Abstract visualization of astronomy museum merging with cosmos, spiral patterns, stars and nebulas, minimalist architectural elements, dark blue and purple, mystical atmosphere, digital art style</span></em></p>]]></description>
