  <item>
    <title>#004 阅book｜《岛上寻星》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671e67fa44ae79002c7654c8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671e67fa44ae79002c7654c8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 16:19:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>准备不定期开一个mini专题，主要分享最近阅读的书籍/essay/论文等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期推荐的是</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36344227/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36344227/"><span>艾伦·莱特曼的《岛上寻星》</span></a><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Particles Ólafur Arnalds（Piano cover by </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@AlexKrasnoskulov" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@AlexKrasnoskulov"><span>Alex Krasnoskulov</span></a><span>)</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：Midjourney v6.1&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>prompt：A minimalist book cover, starry night sky over a small Maine island, deep indigo blue gradient, countless crystal clear stars scattered across the darkness, a small wooden dock extending into calm waters, gentle waves reflecting starlight, ethereal mist floating above water, one silhouetted figure standing at dock's edge looking up at constellations, soft moonlight casting long shadows, photorealistic style, elegant typography, peaceful contemplative mood.</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgk5dtHqxHDRigTJdEIXWcL7ae9r.m4a" length="26969843" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:13:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3MMwLjzp8bcQzrnfUFtsC-QRtC.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>#003 Climate change 全球变暖是骗局吗？温室效应、气候辩论与人类世</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668ae1a5ae8e21859a2dca90</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668ae1a5ae8e21859a2dca90</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jul 2024 18:42:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>点击链接查看播客文本内容：</span><a href="https://overjoyed-balmoral-3a5.notion.site/003-88f9e349bc02409b9cf868a385e84ce4?pvs=4" data-url="https://overjoyed-balmoral-3a5.notion.site/003-88f9e349bc02409b9cf868a385e84ce4?pvs=4"><span>全球变暖是骗局吗？图文信息</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 温室效应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> 丁达尔效应的区分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 冰河时代理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 首张地球俯瞰照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 环保主义的兴起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 贩卖怀疑的商人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> IPCC</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a>人类世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 科学“是”什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面图：midjounery</span></p><span></span><p><span>prompt： Photorealistic composite image of global warming induced climate disasters. Dramatic scene showing multiple climate catastrophes:</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. Foreground: Cracked, parched earth of severe drought, with withered crops and a lone, emaciated animal.</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Middle ground: Raging wildfire consuming a forest, thick smoke billowing into the sky.</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. Background: Coastal city partially submerged due to rising sea levels, with flooded streets and buildings.</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. Sky: Extreme weather events - a massive hurricane approaching from one side, violent thunderstorms on the other.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hyper-detailed textures, volumetric lighting, ominous atmosphere. Color palette dominated by warm oranges and reds contrasting with cool blues of water. Cinematic composition, rule of thirds. 8K resolution, photorealistic rendering, National Geographic style documentation of climate change impacts.</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luU98jg15lvlm500PXMqzdMLkP5J.m4a" length="50444783" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp9GMFyyCRjos2FmAGmyDcv_dslh.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>#002 The Two Cultures《两种文化》by C.P. Snow</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643e87759361a4e7c3e0032c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">643e87759361a4e7c3e0032c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Apr 2023 12:05:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 何为两种文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 两种文化提出的背景分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 两种文化导致的后果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> 两种文化后续的一些讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 第三种文化The Third Culture</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 社会学视角及科学战争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> 国内学者关于两种文化的讨论</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoC6-YWjWC_IR1Cu_GUvB2WWMwUg.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>晚点聊关于ChatGPT的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hL87bOAjv-_uGKcZ2G2vKA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hL87bOAjv-_uGKcZ2G2vKA"><span>哲学家齐泽克发表关于ChatGPT的看法</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtNt_mcnZDVoVNJ_uaxDF3JXVvpJ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>斯普特尼克1号等比例模型</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrrWGet-fQVcchhT-DcP4c95TtcS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>人类首次核试验，三位一体Trinity</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVZnBD72fa0Gj-TEVRjIv56tLy1.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>左：John Brockman 中：Andy Warhol 右：Bob Dylan 三人在工厂合影 1966</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://youtu.be/XVZgNfDQR2A" data-url="https://youtu.be/XVZgNfDQR2A"><span>Steve Fuller UMBC人文论坛演讲：Snow, Two Cultures and the Science Wars</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://news.sciencenet.cn/news/sub26.aspx?id=3427" data-url="https://news.sciencenet.cn/news/sub26.aspx?id=3427"><span>科学网《两种文化大家谈》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1039525/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1039525/"><span>《两种文化》C.P. Snow&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/10532546/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/10532546/"><span>《第三种文化》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/33437080/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/33437080/"><span>《1984》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/7883202/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/7883202/"><span>《没有战争的世界》 World Without War</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26286035/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26286035/"><span>《科学圣徒》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《The Scientist》by Coldplay</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljoblk64_wNBbGWHt8KsL8Kv5n71.m4a" length="39155241" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzYV9SN2loVl96c3J6TWotRjNFbEQ1Y2NGZjcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>#001 Encyclopedia 百科全书</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6416bb608aca9099d7ba8b6c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6416bb608aca9099d7ba8b6c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Mar 2023 07:35:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnKIo9_CC-4HqkxW7mvKEM2Y6bCX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknB7DVgzQRv515HmEP_rMBYGDbe.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>狄德罗肖像画 by 路易斯-米歇尔·范卢 (Louis-Michel Van Loo)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm6nZd7XSvpUnpySjbM4tGA83en0.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 对《十万个为什么》的印象</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 百科全书派</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> 百科全书的缘起</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> 百科全书的发展</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> 知识民主化运动</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 达朗贝尔及其他贡献者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 女性及沙龙文化作为历史背景</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 百科全书作为人类文明遗产的「钥匙」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-Pz1EZfpvGXnOT5SfS1CPIlMsa.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>钱伯斯百科全书扉页</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjirX3fQpQHNTH-sv2NOa7L24ixz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>狄德罗和达朗贝尔百科全书扉页</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJikvgB5T2A6XQxh_MRLIDVjkpj.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>具象人类知识系统</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fotghn_5M5gWC1T295IoYu8CLmdS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>具象人类知识系统（英文译文）</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关数字人文项目：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>芝加哥大学ARTFL项目提供百科全书全文免费访问，用户还可以下载免费的app进行搜索查阅<a data-url="https://encyclopedie.uchicago.edu/" href="https://encyclopedie.uchicago.edu/">encyclopedie.uchicago.edu</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>密歇根大学的百科全书英文版翻译计划 <a data-url="https://quod.lib.umich.edu/d/did/" href="https://quod.lib.umich.edu/d/did/">quod.lib.umich.edu</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>书籍：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《樹之書：知識發展的樹狀視覺史》<a data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35114164/" href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35114164/">book.douban.com</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《公共领域的结构转型》<a data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1009891/" href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1009891/">book.douban.com</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：29 Songs of Various Nations, WoO 158: No. 24, Non, non, Colette n'est point trompeuse</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo7S7MeIBgZwLr_b9ktkY8sgJ3uf.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltp_jz8aROxD2OSzj5yRIgfFDLfY.m4a" length="12404551" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:16:57</itunes:duration>
